<summary>
Pike has the data types <tt>int</tt>, <tt>float</tt>, <tt>string</tt>,
<tt>array</tt>, <tt>mapping</tt>, <tt>multiset</tt>, <tt>program</tt>,
<tt>object</tt> and <tt>function</tt>. The handling of data types in
Pike is advanced, compared to other similar languages.
</summary>

